[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Kupyadoel
Kupyadoel the Angel of Love and Devilun the devil, here to deliver whispers of good and evil~★[p]



[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場える"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/16/kupya2.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Kupyadoel
You really got sliced clean in half...[r]Do you not bleed, by the way?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya3.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
Unlike those wispy rogue spirits, devils have physical bodies and definitely bleed! I closed my wounds with mana.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場える"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/16/kupya1.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Kupyadoel
I see... Ehe, angels can become ephemeral the moment we sense danger coming, so we don't bleed![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya5.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
What the hell?! Are ya gloatin' at me?! Angels have it real good, huh?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya9.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
[font size=25]Wait a minute... That means that presence I sensed at the door wasn't just my imagination.[resetfont][p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場える"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/16/kupya4.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
